#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:154
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:216
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:286
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:351
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:156
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:218
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:288
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:353
msgid ""
"As explained in a `design article <https://design.ros2.org/articles/why_ros2."
"html>`__, we are engaged in the development of a new major version of ROS, "
"called \"ROS 2.\" While the underlying concepts (e.g., publish / subscribe "
"messaging) and goals (e.g., flexibility and reusability) are the same as for "
"ROS 1, we are taking this opportunity to make substantial changes to the "
"system, including changing some of the core APIs. For a deeper treatment of "
"those changes and their rationale, consult the other `ROS 2 design articles "
"<https://design.ros2.org>`__."
msgstr ""
"如 `設計文章 <https://design.ros2.org/articles/why_ros2.html>`__ 所述，我們正"
"在開發一個名為「ROS 2」的 ROS 新主要版本。雖然底層概念（例如發布/訂閱訊息傳"
"遞）和目標（例如靈活性和可重用性）與 ROS 1 相同，我們藉此機會對系統進行重大變"
"更，包括更改一些核心 API。如需深入了解這些變更及其原理，請參閱其他 `ROS 2 設"
"計文章 <https://design.ros2.org>`__。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:166
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:228
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:301
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:366
msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:168
msgid ""
"On February 17, 2016, we are releasing ROS 2 alpha4, code-named **Duct "
"tape**. Our primary goal with this release is to add more features, while "
"also addressing the feedback we received for the previous releases. To that "
"end, we built a set of `demos <../Tutorials>` that show some of the key "
"features of ROS 2. We encourage you to try out those demos, look at the code "
"that implements them, and `provide feedback <../Contact>`. We're especially "
"interested to know how well (or poorly) we're addressing use cases that are "
"important to you."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:180
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:242
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:316
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:383
msgid "Intended audience"
msgstr "目標受眾"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:182
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:244
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:318
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:385
msgid ""
"While everyone is welcome to try out the demos and look through the code, "
"we're aiming this release at people who are already experienced with ROS 1 "
"development. At this point, the ROS 2 documentation is pretty sparse and "
"much of the system is explained by way of how it compares to ROS 1."
msgstr ""
"雖然歡迎所有人試用示範並瀏覽程式碼，但此版本的目標對象是已經具備 ROS 1 開發經"
"驗的人員。目前，ROS 2 的文件還相當稀少，系統的大部分內容是透過與 ROS 1 的比較"
"來說明。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:199
msgid "Improved type support infrastructure, including support for C"
msgstr "改進類型支援基礎設施，包括對 C 的支援"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:200
msgid ""
"Preliminary Python client library, only publishers and subscriptions are "
"supported. Beware, the API is subject to change and is far from complete!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:201
msgid "Added structures for ROS time in C API (still needs C++ API)"
msgstr "在 C API 中新增 ROS 時間結構（仍需 C++ API）"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:203
msgid ""
"New concept of extensible \"time sources\" for ROS Time, the default time "
"source will be like ROS 1 (implementation pending)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:209
msgid "ROS 2 alpha3 release (code name *Cement*; December 2015)"
msgstr "ROS 2 alpha3 發布（代號 *Cement*；2015 年 12 月）"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:230
msgid ""
"On December 18, 2015, we are releasing ROS 2 alpha3, code-named **Cement**. "
"Our primary goal with this release is to add more features, while also "
"addressing the feedback we received for the previous releases. To that end, "
"we built a set of `demos <../Tutorials>` that show some of the key features "
"of ROS 2. We encourage you to try out those demos, look at the code that "
"implements them, and `provide feedback <../Contact>`. We're especially "
"interested to know how well (or poorly) we're addressing use cases that are "
"important to you."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:261
msgid "Updated ``rcl`` interface."
msgstr "更新了 ``rcl`` 介面。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:263
msgid ""
"This interface will be wrapped in order to create language bindings, e.g. "
"``rclpy``."
msgstr "此介面將被封裝以建立語言繫結，例如 ``rclpy``。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:264
msgid ""
"This interface has improved documentation and test coverage over existing "
"interfaces we currently have, e.g. ``rmw`` and ``rclcpp``."
msgstr ""
"此介面比我們目前現有的介面（例如 ``rmw`` 和 ``rclcpp``）具有更好的文件和測試"
"覆蓋率。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:265
msgid ""
"See `rcl headers <https://github.com/ros2/rcl/tree/release-alpha3/rcl/"
"include/rcl>`__."
msgstr ""
"請參閱 `rcl 標頭檔 <https://github.com/ros2/rcl/tree/release-alpha3/rcl/"
"include/rcl>`__。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:267
msgid ""
"Added support in rclcpp for using the TLSF (two-level segregate fit) "
"allocator, a memory allocator design for embedded and real-time systems."
msgstr ""
"在 rclcpp 中新增對使用 TLSF（兩級分離適配）分配器的支援，這是一種針對嵌入式與"
"即時系統的記憶體分配器設計。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:268
msgid ""
"Improved efficiency of MultiThreadedExecutor and fixed numerous bugs with "
"multi-threaded execution, which is now test on CI."
msgstr ""
"提升了 MultiThreadedExecutor 的效率，並修復了多執行緒執行的多個錯誤，現已在 "
"CI 上進行測試。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:269
msgid ""
"Added ability to cancel an Executor from within a callback called in spin."
msgstr "新增了從 spin 中呼叫的回呼內取消 Executor 的能力。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:270
msgid ""
"Added ability for a timer to cancel itself by supporting a Timer callback "
"that accepts a reference to itself as a function parameter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:271
msgid "Added checks for disallowing multiple threads to enter Executor::spin."
msgstr "新增檢查以防止多個執行緒進入 Executor::spin。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:272
msgid ""
"Improved reliability of numerous tests that had been sporadically failing."
msgstr "提升了多個之前偶發性失敗的測試的可靠性。"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:273
msgid ""
"Added support for using Fast RTPS (instead of, e.g., OpenSplice or Connext)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:274
