msgstr "ROS 2 alpha2 發布（代號 *Baling wire*；2015 年 10 月）"

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:303
msgid ""
"On November 3, 2015, we are releasing ROS 2 alpha2, code-named **Baling "
